00:03:51.635 --> 00:03:58.515
dollars of guarantees on debt for a 460 megawatt site tied to a $45 billion anthropic project.

00:03:58.515 --> 00:04:01.775
That deal is not signed, and the terms can still move.

00:04:02.295 --> 00:04:05.575
The same piece sets the pattern next to core weave and firmness.

